{"ch": 88, "verses": [{"n": 1, "ar": "بِسۡمِ اللّٰہِ الرَّحۡمٰنِ الرَّحِیۡمِ ﴿۱﴾", "en": "In the name of Allah, the Gracious, the Merciful.", "w": ["in the name of", "Allah", "the Gracious", "the Merciful", ""]}, {"n": 2, "ar": "ہَلۡ اَتٰٮکَ حَدِیۡثُ الۡغَاشِیَۃِ ؕ﴿۲﴾", "en": "Has there come to thee the news of the overwhelming <i>calamity</i>?", "w": ["has", "there come to thee", "the news", "of the overwhelming <i>calamity</i>", ""]}, {"n": 3, "ar": "وُجُوۡہٌ یَّوۡمَئِذٍ خَاشِعَۃٌ ۙ﴿۳﴾", "en": "<i>Some</i> faces on that day will be downcast;", "w": ["<i>some</i> faces", "on that day", "will be downcast", ""]}, {"n": 4, "ar": "عَامِلَۃٌ نَّاصِبَۃٌ ۙ﴿۴﴾", "en": "Toiling, weary.", "w": ["toiling", "weary", ""]}, {"n": 5, "ar": "تَصۡلٰی نَارًا حَامِیَۃً ۙ﴿۵﴾", "en": "<i>They</i> shall enter a burning Fire;", "w": ["<i>they</i> shall enter", "Fire", "a burning", ""]}, {"n": 6, "ar": "تُسۡقٰی مِنۡ عَیۡنٍ اٰنِیَۃٍ ؕ﴿۶﴾", "en": "<i>And</i> will be made to drink from a boiling spring;", "w": ["<i>and</i> will be made to drink", "from", "spring", "a boiling", ""]}, {"n": 7, "ar": "لَیۡسَ لَہُمۡ طَعَامٌ اِلَّا مِنۡ ضَرِیۡعٍ ۙ﴿۷﴾", "en": "They will have no food save that of dry, bitter and thorny herbage,", "w": ["no", "they will have", "food", "save", "that of", "dry, bitter and thorny herbage", ""]}, {"n": 8, "ar": "لَّا یُسۡمِنُ وَلَا یُغۡنِیۡ مِنۡ جُوۡعٍ ؕ﴿۸﴾", "en": "Which will neither fatten, nor satisfy hunger.", "w": ["neither", "which will fatten", "nor", "satisfy", "from", "hunger", ""]}, {"n": 9, "ar": "وُجُوۡہٌ یَّوۡمَئِذٍ نَّاعِمَۃٌ ۙ﴿۹﴾", "en": "<i>And some</i> faces on that day will be joyful,", "w": ["<i>and some</i> faces", "on that day", "will be joyful", ""]}, {"n": 10, "ar": "لِّسَعۡیِہَا رَاضِیَۃٌ ۙ﴿۱۰﴾", "en": "Well pleased with their labour,", "w": ["with their labour", "well pleased", ""]}, {"n": 11, "ar": "فِیۡ جَنَّۃٍ عَالِیَۃٍ ﴿ۙ۱۱﴾", "en": "In a lofty Garden,", "w": ["in", "Garden", "a lofty", ""]}, {"n": 12, "ar": "لَّا تَسۡمَعُ فِیۡہَا لَاغِیَۃً ﴿ؕ۱۲﴾", "en": "Wherein thou wilt hear no idle talk;", "w": ["no", "thou wilt hear", "wherein", "idle talk", ""]}, {"n": 13, "ar": "فِیۡہَا عَیۡنٌ جَارِیَۃٌ ﴿ۘ۱۳﴾", "en": "Therein is a running spring,", "w": ["therein is a", "spring", "running", ""]}, {"n": 14, "ar": "فِیۡہَا سُرُرٌ مَّرۡفُوۡعَۃٌ ﴿ۙ۱۴﴾", "en": "Therein are raised couches,", "w": ["therein", "couches", "are raised", ""]}, {"n": 15, "ar": "وَّاَکۡوَابٌ مَّوۡضُوۡعَۃٌ ﴿ۙ۱۵﴾", "en": "And goblets properly placed,", "w": ["and goblets", "properly placed", ""]}, {"n": 16, "ar": "وَّنَمَارِقُ مَصۡفُوۡفَۃٌ ﴿ۙ۱۶﴾", "en": "And cushions <i>beautifully</i> ranged,", "w": ["and cushions", "<i>beautifully</i> ranged", ""]}, {"n": 17, "ar": "وَّزَرَابِیُّ مَبۡثُوۡثَۃٌ ﴿ؕ۱۷﴾", "en": "And carpets <i>tastefully</i> spread.", "w": ["and carpets", "<i>tastefully</i> spread", ""]}, {"n": 18, "ar": "اَفَلَا یَنۡظُرُوۡنَ اِلَی الۡاِبِلِ کَیۡفَ خُلِقَتۡ ﴿ٝ۱۸﴾", "en": "Do they not then look at the camel, how it is created?", "w": ["do not then", "they look", "at", "the camel", "how", "it is created", ""]}, {"n": 19, "ar": "وَاِلَی السَّمَآءِ کَیۡفَ رُفِعَتۡ ﴿ٝ۱۹﴾", "en": "And at the heaven, how it is raised high?", "w": ["and at", "the heaven", "how", "it is raised high", ""]}, {"n": 20, "ar": "وَاِلَی الۡجِبَالِ کَیۡفَ نُصِبَتۡ ﴿ٝ۲۰﴾", "en": "[✲]And at the mountains, how they are set up?", "w": ["and at", "the mountains", "how", "they are set up", ""]}, {"n": 21, "ar": "وَاِلَی الۡاَرۡضِ کَیۡفَ سُطِحَتۡ ﴿ٝ۲۱﴾", "en": "And at the earth, how it is spread out?", "w": ["and at", "the earth", "how", "it is spread out", ""]}, {"n": 22, "ar": "فَذَکِّرۡ ۟ؕ اِنَّمَاۤ اَنۡتَ مُذَکِّرٌ ﴿ؕ۲۲﴾", "en": "Admonish, therefore, for thou art but an admonisher;", "w": ["admonish", "", "therefore", "for thou art", "but an admonisher", ""]}, {"n": 23, "ar": "لَسۡتَ عَلَیۡہِمۡ بِمُصَۜیۡطِرٍ ﴿ۙ۲۳﴾", "en": "[✲]Thou hast no authority to <i>compel</i> them.", "w": ["thou hast no", "to <i>compel</i> them", "authority", ""]}, {"n": 24, "ar": "اِلَّا مَ